      "text": "here am I, send me, 2 Ne. 16:8 (Isa. 6:8). the Lord has sent his holy prophets among men, Mosiah 3:13. the Father sent the Son, 3 Ne. 20:26. the Lord will send messenger to prepare way, 3 Ne. 24:1 (Mal. 3:1). the Lord will send Elijah the prophet, 3 Ne. 25:5 (Mal. 4:5). Christ came into world to do the Father’s will because the Father sent him, 3 Ne. 27:13. wo unto those who will not hearken to words of those whom Jesus has sent among them, 3 Ne. 28:34. he who will not believe Christ will not believe the Father who sent him, Ether 4:12. every thing which persuades to believe in Christ is sent by power and gift of Christ, Moro. 7:16.",
